// M5-A3P-1000 (Act III production, ADR 0207). Built from the Act III draft (docs/kb/story/act3/drafts/README.md).
// Ch17 B01 "Pulled from the sea" (C, 2 min). act3_ch17.md §2 B01. Grey dawn after Ch16's swept-away: a flat sea gone
// wrong, the party in the water among broken Choir stone. The Hollowmere ship's current-song comes before the ship does
// (the song Liss sang into the fog, ch15_hollowmere_answered). Kerrid holds the rope for each of them and is hauled up
// LAST, as on a stair; nobody remarks it. Asha holds her full sleeve (S7) in her fist the whole way up.
// RULE 5: held light only; nothing rises. The captain hands back Tobin's lamp box (ADR 0204 §13: left aboard in Ch16).
title: ch17_pulled_from_the_sea
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
@letterbox on
@fade in 3.0
@music silence fade=0.0
@camera D01
@sfx sea_flat_lap
@wait 4.0
<<if $ch15_hollowmere_answered>>
    @sfx current_song at=fog vol=0.4
    @wait 3.0
    Liss [surprised]: That's ours. That's the answer. #line:ch17_pulled_001
<<else>>
    @sfx current_song at=fog vol=0.4
    @wait 3.0
<<endif>>
@music hollowmere fade=4.0
@camera D02
@anim kerrid hold_rope
@wait 2.0
@anim toma climb rope
@anim ysolde climb rope
@anim pell climb rope
@anim liss climb rope
@anim rhen climb rope
@anim asha climb rope
@wait 4.0
@camera D03
@anim asha clutch sleeve
@wait 2.0
@anim kerrid climb rope
@wait 3.0
@camera D04
Hull_captain as "Ship's captain" [neutral]: Said we'd wait. #line:ch17_pulled_002
@anim hull_captain give liss
Hull_captain as "Ship's captain" [tender]: Kept it dry. #line:ch17_pulled_003 #tn:"He gives back the cracked lamp holding Tobin's light. Liss said 'Keep it dry.' when she left it with him (Ch16)."
@wait 2.0
Liss [tender]: Thank you. #line:ch17_pulled_004
@wait 2.5
<<set $ch17_started = true>>
@fade out 2.0
@letterbox off
===
